{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0173_1000_006mak", "source_sha256": "f5275d4fc7a24e1c79103d490fa9d7039d2531ad98218639b70d92f2d5ba4875", "ja": "はあっ……なんてかわいいんだ……。\nまた会いたいなぁ……。", "zh": "哈啊……怎么会这么可爱……。\n真想再见到它啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0173_1001_p", "source_sha256": "14015c5ee2a40f66f0bcf1133f5a2318ef8c8fe920651a43a9cf0c92c5ca373b", "ja": "どうしたんだ、真？\nスマホを見つめて、とろけそうな声出して……。", "zh": "怎么了，真？\n盯着手机，还发出那种陶醉的声音……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0173_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "35ca70aacb8b8dadae564ce63f66b15f0dbc4f757706af3bfb648b140e4cb473", "ja": "ボク、あの子が恋しいんです！", "zh": "我好想念那孩子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0173_1003_p", "source_sha256": "1e74b05b7060aace672c003bb094ddb35984210d9cb6d202e8212b3deec1f1fc", "ja": "えっ？　いつの間に、真にそんな相手が……！？", "zh": "咦？真什么时候有那种对象了……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0173_1004_006mak", "source_sha256": "c9f86877ddcfb1462f423df54b72bd55ba357abf9b714b4195fc631acf0470ed", "ja": "ち、違いますよ！　この前、お仕事で\nカワイイワンちゃんと共演したじゃないですか！", "zh": "不、不是的！前段时间不是还在工作中和可爱的狗狗一起演出了吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0173_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "c0cf8e1d713eefa1bbae086db16a5a250dcfb3a2cd1e07bd7f4974ea30d41743", "ja": "その時に撮った写真を見てたら、\n思い出しちゃって……。", "zh": "看着那时候拍的照片，就不由得想起来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0173_1006_p", "source_sha256": "2114b5882c5b79adb39eec95e386e8483191da3d1e668501a0121b52c7f2566c", "ja": "ワンちゃんか……真がそんなに共演犬に惚れ込む\nなんて……でも確かに、相性よかったよな。", "zh": "小狗啊……没想到真居然这么喜欢那只共演的狗……不过确实，你们挺合得来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0173_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "bb9559057e2211c2676be6c4ee563af6bb3708bb9749dcdfdb23b591e94700e0", "ja": "はい！　一緒のステージ、楽しかった～！　せっかく\n仲良くなれたし、どうにかしてまた会いたいです！", "zh": "是！一起登台，真的很开心～！好不容易和它变得这么要好，真想想办法再见到它！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0173_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "1dfaf645202564f3a076f00b00810036e9b0e8e74220fc4d69e72b06f55cd2aa", "ja": "ボク、もともと犬は好きなんですけど、\nあの子はまた、特別っていうか……。", "zh": "我本来就喜欢狗，不过，那孩子嘛，怎么说呢……格外特别。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0173_1009_p", "source_sha256": "7dbd8ca4fc3a2f243189d8c50b0d33db77acd77b185ba97b67191a26794cf2b3", "ja": "そうか。でも、また会うのは難し……あ、待てよ？\n確かその、真が共演したワンちゃんって、お店に……。", "zh": "这样啊。不过，要再见到它恐怕很难……啊，等等？我记得，那个和真一起出演的狗狗，好像在店里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0173_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "34b739eeb79bf5c17488de972c01a047b3f304db01a8de8f6c1e09f94fb83536", "ja": "お店……？　ワンちゃん……。\nあ！　そ、そうだ！　『ワンちゃんカフェ』だぁ！！", "zh": "店里……？狗狗……。\n啊！对、对了！是“狗狗咖啡馆”！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0173_1011_p", "source_sha256": "b7dddf1003eef8a376bc1c676d8bf2e6128665abc998521b273ba396645c2719", "ja": "そうそう。あの子はカフェに時々出てるらしいから。\nお店に行けば、会えるかもしれないぞ。", "zh": "对对。听说那孩子偶尔会在咖啡馆出现。  \n去店里的话，说不定能见到它。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0173_1012_006mak", "source_sha256": "3727df37273e5d8f2910299b7781110102c8b8b9da0bc429c78d7a3f62e530a9", "ja": "{$P$}！　ボク、そのカフェに\n行きたいですっ！　連れてってください！　今すぐ！！", "zh": "{$P$}！我想去那家\n咖啡厅！请带我去吧！立刻就去！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0173_1013_p", "source_sha256": "a229811a940de1e759748350e3163a2a92966a5a50403f5c7b1dfd1bed1096fc", "ja": "いや、これから別の仕事だし、今すぐは無理……。", "zh": "不，现在要去做别的工作，马上去可不行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0173_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "2664f477366c781897c1b1e21d7415723a0adf8ff82e650e99680dd3af0a2e75", "ja": "じゃあ、次のお仕事が終わったらで！　約束ですよ！\nああ、ワンちゃんカフェ～。早く行きたいな～。", "zh": "那就等下一个工作结束后吧！说好了哦！\n啊，狗狗咖啡馆～真想早点去啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0173_1015_006mak", "source_sha256": "97d36c089863f4d8af018a77afe1e0fc9bcca8386e120785948e318a8e886def", "ja": "あの子に会えたら、ギュって抱っこして～、\nなでなでして～、ごはん食べさせて～……ああ～。", "zh": "要是能见到那孩子，就紧紧抱住～，摸摸它～，喂它吃饭～……啊啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0173_1016_p", "source_sha256": "36ee8adfe91a7725bb322ced939193ab527c4bd03f9551fc990cd324c03772d7", "ja": "おーい！　仕事が終わったらだぞ、真！\nカフェには確認入れとくから。しっかり頼むぞ！", "zh": "喂——！等工作结束之后啊，真！我会先跟咖啡馆确认好的。就拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0173_1017_006mak", "source_sha256": "ac7960b042664ecb711a4bfdd5dd5b054387f7d461565a7e8ae316a341e58b81", "ja": "うわあっ！　そ、そうでした！　うぅ～ダメダメ！\nボク、軽くランニングして、頭冷やしてきます！", "zh": "哇啊！对、对哦！呜呜～不行不行！\n我去慢跑一下，让自己冷静冷静！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0173_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "7e27a855503751f8e4a6b2eb5bef41ab4a1baca25247bf29f482e33baa92e634", "ja": "……カフェには、ドッグランもあるかな？\n一緒に走り回れたら、楽しいだろうなぁ♪　わんっ♪", "zh": "……咖啡厅里会有狗狗跑道吗？\n要是能一起跑来跑去的话，一定会很开心吧♪　汪♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
